\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. God make my life a little light
\par Within the world to glow;
\par A little flame that burneth bright,
\par Wherever I may go.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. God make my life a little flower
\par That giveth joy to all,
\par Content to bloom in native bower,
\par Although the place be small.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. God make my life a little song
\par That conforteth the sad,
\par That helpeth others to be strong,
\par And makes the singer glad.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. God make my life a little staff
\par Whereon the weak may rest,
\par That so what health and strength I have
\par May serve my neighbours best.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. God make my life a little hymn
\par Of tenderness and praise,
\par Of faith, that never waxeth dim,
\par And all His wondrous ways.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

